{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_372C00","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，你已经穿过村子北边了吧？那辆载着核武器的卡车似乎开进了山里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"那里恐怕就是货物的最终目的地。再往后的情况我们一无所知，小心行事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""}]}